{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──じゃ、ラスト１問\r\n『reward』","trans":"——那么，最后一题\n“reward”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017300010","name":"霧子","text":"だれだれに褒美を与える……","trans":"给某某……以褒奖……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"よし、全問正解！\r\n──じゃあこの単語帳はプレゼントだ","trans":"好，全题都答对了！\n——那这本单词本送你了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017300030","name":"霧子","text":"────ふふっ……\r\n次の……単語……","trans":"————呵呵……\n下一个……单词……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-18","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……ん？\r\n『delight』……えっと……","trans":"……嗯？\n“delight”……那个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017300040","name":"霧子","text":"歓喜……大喜び……\r\nです……","trans":"欢喜……大喜……\n……的意思……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}